      "summary": "Schema-v2 file navigation adapts curated architecture and XML project references. Bounded queries reconstruct Git revisions with disposable caches. Separate offline history exports connect selected files/concept sources to first-parent commits, highlight file changes and compare revision relationships, preserving deleted nodes and parallel references. Canonical tracked graphs contain no enclosing commit metadata. Protected index hooks and CI enforce outputs; worktree previews include uncommitted sources. Syntax/human evidence is not a semantic call graph.",
